        "edit": "Fix the two malformed case literals in the 3-to-8 decoder: 3'b100 was 8'b0001_000 (7 bits) and is corrected to 8'b0001_0000; 3'b111 was 8'b100_0000 (7 bits) and is corrected to 8'b1000_0000. This restores the one-hot output for a=3'b100 (cycle9 expected 00010000) and a=3'b111.",
